{"lang":"en","summary":"CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">created</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 2026<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>07<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>14 21<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">43</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">updated</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 2026<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>07<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>14 21<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">43</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">aliases</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> 第11章：Tiled<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>GEMM<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Shared<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>与<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Double<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Buffer\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 第11章：Tiled<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>GEMM<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Shared<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>与<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Double<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>Buffer\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">source</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> https<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/11<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>tiled<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>gemm\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> gpu<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>computing\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> CUDA\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> 系列教程\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> AI\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">category</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> GPU计算/CUDA\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">cssclasses</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> gpu<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>computing\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> series\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">note</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">series</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout=\"info\" class=\"callout drop-shadow\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-info\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">文档定位</div></div><div class=\"callout-content ab-note\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AI 整理 + 学习笔记</strong>。原文出自杨艺韬《CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路》一书。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">原文链接:<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/11-tiled-gemm\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/11-tiled-gemm</a><br>\n系列入口:<a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/README/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/README/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">大模型/CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路/README</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\"Tiling is to GPU what divide-and-conquer is to algorithms — once you see it, you start seeing it everywhere.\"<br>\n——CUDA 教学传统</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"为什么需要 Tiling\" dir=\"auto\">为什么需要 Tiling</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">第 10 章看到朴素 GEMM 只能跑到 1% 峰值，瓶颈是<strong>实际算术强度只有 ~1</strong>。要让算力发挥出来，必须把 A 和 B 的元素<strong>复用</strong>——同一个元素被读到 SMEM 后，被多个线程多次使用，再写回。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tiling（瓦片化）就是这种复用的工程实现。基本结构是：</p>\n<div class=\"mermaid\"><svg id=\"m2b307aee399644ff\" width=\"290.1328125\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" class=\"flowchart\" height=\"1228.25\" viewBox=\"0 0 290.1328125 1228.25\" role=\"graphics-document document\" aria-roledescription=\"flowchart-v2\"><style>#m2b307aee399644ff{font-family:var(--font-mermaid);font-size:16px;fill:#333;}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{